OL,3,AWarrant for dad of A66 teen over
OL,4,Afuneral assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arrest warrant has been issued for a
OL,7,Fman who attacked a celebrant at the
OL,8,Ffuneral of his son, one of five men and
OL,9,Ftwo police officers killed in a head-on
OL,10,Fcrash.
OL,12,FGye Worthy, 40, admitted common assault
OL,13,Fand resisting arrest at his son's
OL,14,Ffuneral at Teesside Crematorium in
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough after a disturbance
OL,16,Fduring the service on 9 September.
OL,18,FHis son Cole Worthy, 17, died when the
OL,19,FVolkswagen Passat he and four others
OL,20,Fwere in collided with a marked armed
OL,21,Fpolice car on the A66 in South Bank in
OL,22,Fthe early hours of 22 August.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
